WEBVTT

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:05.500
(Hey! Hey!)

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:09.000
(Hey! Hey!)

00:00:15.800 --> 00:00:19.300
Red cape on and spikes up high

00:00:19.300 --> 00:00:22.800
Tiny feet, but watch me fly

00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:25.900
Something big is on the road

00:00:25.900 --> 00:00:30.000
I point my paw and say "Go home!"

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:33.500
Spin it, spin it, magic in my hand

00:00:33.500 --> 00:00:35.400
One, two, three, and

00:00:35.400 --> 00:00:38.900
Out of my way! Out of my way!

00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:40.900
I'm the little boss today

00:00:40.900 --> 00:00:42.400
Pop, pop, pop, they float away

00:00:42.400 --> 00:00:54.700
Out of my way! Out of my way!

00:00:56.300 --> 00:00:59.900
A dragon roaring on the hill

00:00:59.900 --> 00:01:03.200
A wobbly jelly, never still

00:01:03.200 --> 00:01:06.400
A grumpy giant in the way

00:01:06.400 --> 00:01:10.600
I stamp my foot, he runs away

00:01:10.600 --> 00:01:14.000
Spin it, spin it, magic in my hand

00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:15.800
One, two, three, and

00:01:15.800 --> 00:01:19.400
Out of my way! Out of my way!

00:01:19.400 --> 00:01:21.100
I'm the little boss today

00:01:21.100 --> 00:01:22.800
Pop, pop, pop, they float away

00:01:22.800 --> 00:01:29.400
Out of my way! Out of my way!

00:01:29.400 --> 00:01:31.200
Who's the boss? (Me!)

00:01:31.200 --> 00:01:32.900
Who's the boss? (Me!)

00:01:32.900 --> 00:01:36.400
Little spikes and a big red cape

00:01:36.400 --> 00:01:42.100
Who's the boss? (Me! Me! Me!)

00:01:43.600 --> 00:01:47.300
Sun goes down, I'm walking home

00:01:47.300 --> 00:01:50.800
Panda, Fox and Camel know

00:01:50.800 --> 00:01:54.200
Who was brave and who was best

00:01:54.200 --> 00:01:59.400
Okay... maybe now I'll rest

00:01:59.400 --> 00:02:01.200
(Hey! Hey!)

00:02:01.200 --> 00:02:04.600
Out of my way! Out of my way!

00:02:04.600 --> 00:02:06.400
I'm the little boss today

00:02:06.400 --> 00:02:08.100
Pop, pop, pop, they float away

00:02:08.100 --> 00:02:21.800
See you tomorrow! Out of my way!

00:02:11.500 --> 00:02:21.800
Out of my way!
